{"reviewId": "14026945_86v31A5W3", "review": {"abstract": "有一个结论是可以肯定的，即衰退和萧条的连接点一定是一个康波大宗商品价格的最低点，这一点为前五次康波的价格形态所证明（见图1-38）", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterUid": 6, "content": "这个很准啊，根据美国大宗商品指数GSG，最低点是在2020年4月份，也就是说，从那时开始，就进入了萧条，2020年刚好是疫情期间，各行各业确实一片萧条，破产，裁员，大环境，成为了这几年的热门话题。\n萧条已经持续6年，本轮AI新技术突破，将有望带领走出萧条期。", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 1, "range": "29296-29361", "createTime": 1769614111, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "14026945_86v31A5W3", "userVid": 14026945, "topics": [], "flag": 1073741824, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 14026945, "name": "Justin", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/hticZVEqpG1AsuRmAPtYPAIvY9MDKZSIAOicuQh9XFJZ874mKclohrlkcicp1z5qepicbLsvIQIMTO0/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-1000", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 1000}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 11, "likes": [{"userVid": 388091364, "name": "山山", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/YsIttiaefQf6wib4iaWjQg00EI4I76jJDB9iaoO3czRribGchibu3haLHGKZ3fRbFdbTkXMzsc5cHTtuXpd2ApaUJudnQRs3GheOckmPImemb55Ac/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M15-1-0", "desc": "21天阅读挑战", "title